            "block_content": "Attention is drawn to the possibility that some of the elements of this document may be the subject of patent rights. ISO and IEC shall not be held responsible for identifying any or all such patent rights. Details of any patent rights identified during the development of the document will be in the Introduction and/or on the ISO list of patent declarations received (see  $ \\underline{\\text{www.iso.org/patents}} $) or the IEC list of patent declarations received (see  $ \\underline{\\text{https://patents.iec.ch}} $).",
